description=Zero-KernelSU ROM stability, gaming & battery fix for TECNO POVA 5 Pro 5G (LH8n) on HyperOS. Neutralizes Mali trans_stat and aw22xxx RGB panics, eliminates IVirtualHal stalls, fixes SELinuxMMAC/clns-14 libMiMainColor, uncaps 120Hz gaming, aligns ART madvise, tunes UFS/ZRAM/GED, disables MTK engineering loggers with Fast-Doze deep sleep, and enforces 240Hz FT8726 TDDI touch responsiveness with 6.5ms SurfaceFlinger frame pacing and EAS CPU frequency ramp.
